<title>JAPAN: FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF JAPAN STOCKS VIA 12 FIRMS.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF JAPAN STOCKS VIA 12 FIRMS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 12 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Tuesday showed a net buying stance of 2.1 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor sell orders totalled 27.5 million shares while buy orders amounted to 29.6 million shares.</p>
